## The Three Preset World Maps

Hollow Shore ships with three hand-crafted world maps. On new game, the player selects a world (or it is chosen by seed number). All three share the same 3×3 section layout and Sanctum placement — what changes is the biome flavoring, terrain aesthetics, resource distribution, and named sub-locations within each section. This gives replayability without true procedural generation, which would exceed GBA RAM limits.

