## Endgame & Post-Game

### Building the Tide Portal

- All 6 Portal Pieces collected and combined at the Alchemy Table
- Portal frame requires additional rare materials gathered across all biomes — incentivizes engaging with every major system
- Placing the completed portal anywhere in Section 5 triggers the ending sequence
- Credits roll with world seed and playtime displayed

### Post-Game Sandbox Mode

After the ending, the player may choose to **Leave** (end) or **Stay** (continue in sandbox mode).

- Sandbox mode removes the portal goal — the world persists indefinitely
- Monster escalation continues past Day 15+ siege events — ongoing survival challenge
- All crafting, farming, and building remains fully available with no cap
- Secondary cosmetic goal: fully upgrade the home base to Metal tier across all sections

---

## Save System

- **Auto-save** triggers when sleeping in a bed (bed also skips time up to 12 hours, player's choice)
- **Manual save** available from the pause menu at any time
- Uses **128KB SRAM** cartridge — higher end but used by complex GBA titles like Golden Sun
- Save data compressed aggressively: tile states stored as bitfields, structures encoded by type and tier
- **One named save file** per cartridge — appropriate for GBA format
- Save data includes: current section, inventory, world day count, all section tile states, boss defeat flags, current season, and weather state

